<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): metres the metronome and the beat grid count in different ways. Bar 1: 6/4 (the old metronome counts six quarters; the graph counts two dotted halves). Bar 2: 6/8 (two). Bar 3: 9/8 (three). Bar 4: 12/8 (four). Bar 5: 3/8 (one). Bar 6: 5/4. Bars 2-4 are repeated. A 3/8 bar and a 12/8 bar in a loop window end on the repeat. -->
